            <div xml:id="m-200368bd-f2e5-4a65-958a-c51ab53d2f2b">
              <lg xml:id="m-f2ecbc9c-019b-44f7-a7a7-d3b5b893ec73">
                <l xml:id="m-abbdc42e-2355-4d42-a688-26c45dd868de" facs="#m-476ef5ad-10b7-48a5-8c04-1a36ce83e3cd" label="text-like">The Holy Name of Jesus.</l><l xml:id="m-1190f3d4-59f9-4e37-b526-ea265d1a0483" facs="#m-21d79a22-488b-4d9c-aad2-dc65d8992c00" label="ambiguous">449</l><l xml:id="m-1313ffad-e47d-4d47-8870-bfc335f833cb" facs="#m-16067293-62c2-493f-866c-77be0a100cd9" label="lyrics-like">quóni-am tu, Dó- mine, su-á-vis et mí- tis</l><l xml:id="m-b8793562-83c4-4456-9bd1-b3e97e6dfe10" facs="#m-6ae51412-ed3c-40db-a8fe-9d8cbd09bd0c" label="ambiguous">num:</l><l xml:id="m-677adaf0-8bb5-4155-80c6-e4f72a9a7127" facs="#m-4ab5c709-89f1-4efe-8481-a7ff5a1cff6f" label="lyrics-like">et múl-tae mi-se-ricór- di-ae</l><l xml:id="m-8097808c-ab3a-4343-9fc0-070c90461714" facs="#m-f4c48987-b923-4bc1-b532-8847a70e9dc7" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus invo¬</l><l xml:id="m-25c3038c-5a8d-497d-993a-b72d456c82bd" facs="#m-0de5fce8-3b5d-4794-853d-1d9ec79e1283" label="ambiguous">es:</l><l xml:id="m-0e7ec90f-2951-4d92-8341-ed72eabab8ee" facs="#m-f63b79f3-f46f-4e5a-9066-eba8f9ed1806" label="lyrics-like">cánti-bus te,</l><l xml:id="m-481f0ece-1c6d-4f60-94c8-73e23a48dbe3" facs="#m-a5fc7f62-16ff-4932-a14c-f4be638348b4" label="ambiguous">le¬</l><l xml:id="m-e776fa33-d097-4206-8909-10dd573e682b" facs="#m-6746362d-8f19-48ba-b5d9-b84371bfa2c1" label="ambiguous">al¬</l><l xml:id="m-086db281-df34-4299-80e2-a0c3b44b78b9" facs="#m-c29bc33c-59a2-4616-9e56-8956ee6e83ee" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-986c4619-db85-4a4d-9a9d-7715998dc4f9" facs="#m-62e1c642-cd5d-4fe4-a7b0-365035de1663" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-16c56294-d2a7-4cdd-ac49-8a5ab01f6d7a" facs="#m-ef0474bd-c544-4d0e-923e-81de2d4a47b9" label="lyrics-like">D Enedictio tua, clementíssime! Christi offérimus tibi: ut majestáti</l><l xml:id="m-48fcabb2-da0a-4bee-8b82-08eea23c7d9c" facs="#m-114bf133-bf38-4909-a368-1cc697f98397" label="lyrics-like">D Deus, qua omnis viget creatú¬</l><l xml:id="m-333892fa-aeaa-4bd6-a314-9414eb3dc5e8" facs="#m-b9c7fc22-5bcb-415b-88b7-fdf6f5584eb2" label="lyrics-like">tuae placére possit ad laudem, et</l><l xml:id="m-08bc371d-e7b8-4c4b-b809-44976383eccf" facs="#m-0ea75634-77fd-4cfc-8abc-2ad30c03c1b5" label="lyrics-like">nobis proficere ad salútem. Per</l><l xml:id="m-91418405-b1d3-4ce0-b0b4-0176471f491b" facs="#m-6cea3da9-5135-4ee3-b734-b36beac46876" label="lyrics-like">ra, sanctíficet, quaésumus, hoc sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7e0058c-d198-45cd-8859-55b661ba7e63" facs="#m-fa12db2b-843a-4ce2-913a-2b3539d77dd2" label="lyrics-like">eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2d9ea416-d77a-4b6e-8d68-2aa10324341a" facs="#m-f451a28e-7b61-4fc4-b5a5-cddd08a32665" label="lyrics-like">crificium nostrum, quod ad glóriam</l><l xml:id="m-77015bbe-0c49-42a7-b623-7a886e12b036" facs="#m-119d31ec-c485-4001-937f-f3be7c1086a1" label="lyrics-like">nóminis Filii tui Dómini nostri Jesu</l><l xml:id="m-931c7e7c-b6e3-4e5a-a326-785d8cdbfe1f" facs="#m-55ea0bec-1975-4198-94a3-9e5a6c1093e6" label="text-like">Preface or the Nativity. p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-192ff595-6be4-4867-8cc2-af2edbaf708a" facs="#m-2a9f6a68-fe73-48b0-80e6-3cdc71151104" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-f011883c-796b-4210-a736-e65980b2df42" facs="#m-ce6e3c35-cc40-465d-9ecf-3d5078222538" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-bcd618c1-c1c5-40d4-a262-49aff0cd068f" facs="#m-7b7ed797-cee0-46c2-ac11-6424d339f5cf" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-b8715bd6-a05b-4d2d-916f-22aac219cee9" facs="#m-6c452ff5-cc2b-47cc-be86-c23f10f70002" label="lyrics-like">-mnes géntes “ quascúmque fe-ci- sti, vé¬ ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-8da6af08-2be3-42f6-a1bb-2ff473c0f8e5" facs="#m-8968d498-0d50-47a6-9465-bb76200dcce0" label="lyrics-like">ent, et ado- rá- bunt co-ram te Dómi-ne, et glo¬</l><l xml:id="m-3dc1ac3d-a1cc-489f-83a7-e373bd73036a" facs="#m-ae1c2186-ccb0-47c2-a1dc-6643d8ef5197" label="lyrics-like">ri-fi-cá-bunt nómen tú- um: quóni-am mágnus es tu,</l><l xml:id="m-d12f3dd6-2771-45bd-ac9f-8ae6604324e5" facs="#m-b690cf47-d5eb-4191-b249-c2746cda7aab" label="lyrics-like">Dé- us só¬</l><l xml:id="m-de9861b4-9d32-4bc3-9106-373428d444e8" facs="#m-4eb81d2c-9892-4ce7-b743-5ba7ed4f90a8" label="lyrics-like">et fá¬ ci-ens mi-ra-bí- li-a:</l><l xml:id="m-678f5920-c837-47db-8929-c37e9f52b875" facs="#m-b1909d40-6c45-4f5d-8bde-aa20e78d8f6e" label="ambiguous">tu es</l><l xml:id="m-5788da9f-3b9c-4044-b0f7-dd941607ad79" facs="#m-aecff05c-cc7c-453d-803b-53a9cdd2afb0" label="lyrics-like">lus, alle lú¬ ia</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
